# Routing

## GoRouter Only

- `context.go()`, `context.push()`, `context.pop()`, `context.pushReplacement()`
- Never `Navigator.push()`, `Navigator.pushNamed()` directly

## Route Constants

```dart
abstract final class AuthRoutes {
  static const String login = '/login';
  static const String register = '/register';
}
```

## Auth Guard

```dart
GoRouter(
  refreshListenable: sl<AuthStatusNotifier>(),
  redirect: (context, state) { /* check auth */ },
)
```

Never check auth inside widget `build()`.

## Protected Routes

Declared in `AppRoutes.protected` set — redirect to `/login` when unauthenticated.

## Feature-Owned Routes

Each feature package defines `<Feature>Routes` and registers with app router.
App routers: `buildProviderRouter()` / `buildClientRouter()` in `apps/*/lib/src/routing/`

## Typed Extras

Pass typed args via `state.extra`:
```dart
final args = state.extra as OtpArgs;
```

## Shell Navigation

`StatefulShellRoute.indexedStack` for bottom-nav tabs (provider app).

## Deep Linking

Route paths must be stable and URL-safe (no spaces, use hyphens).

## DI in Routes

Inject via `BlocProvider` in `GoRoute.builder` — never `sl<T>()` in widget constructor.
